- **Python as glue** — the cloud runs on APIs; Python scripts call them, transform the answers, and automate the boring parts.
- **Lists and dicts** — lists are ordered collections, dicts are key→value maps; JSON APIs speak almost entirely in these two shapes.
- **JSON/YAML** — JSON is the API wire format; YAML is the human-friendly config format (indentation is syntax).
- **Requests and errors** — every API call can fail; check status codes, handle exceptions, never assume success.

