1. **Headline** — pick one of the five headline formulas, adapt it to your target role, and draft two variants. 2. **About section** — fill the skeleton: hook line, two proof points with metrics, one call to action. 3. **Featured** — pin 2–3 repos or demos with one-line outcome captions each. 4. **Skills ordering** — reorder your skills so the target-role keywords lead; endorse nothing you can't defend in an interview. 5. **Weekly post draft** — write this week's build-in-public post (project demo + lesson learned + tags) and schedule it. 6. **Outreach scripts** — draft a connection request and a hiring-manager note, each referencing something specific about the recipient. Bring the headline and About draft to Noah for the line-by-line review.

