- **Developer Associate — prove the pipeline** — AWS Certified Developer – Associate validates the build-and-ship loop: CI/CD, serverless, SDKs, and deployment — the DevOps modules 2, 5, 7, 9 plus AWS Module 3 are the prep core. - **Terraform Associate — prove the language** — the HashiCorp Certified: Terraform Associate is a vocabulary-and-workflow exam: HCL syntax, state, modules, and the init/plan/apply loop from DevOps Module 3 and Mission 1. - **CKA — prove the hands** — the Certified Kubernetes Administrator is performance-based: imperative kubectl speed drills and live troubleshooting from DevOps Module 6 and Mission 2. No multiple-choice muscle memory will save you — only reps. - **The expert/professional tier — prove the system** — Azure DevOps Engineer Expert (AZ-400) and AWS DevOps Engineer – Professional test end-to-end delivery thinking across the full DevOps track plus AWS Modules 3–5. Sit them last.

